      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 5.24,
          "end": 5.72,
          "en": "All right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.72,
          "end": 10.85,
          "en": "In this lecture, we are going to learn about Prim's algorithm, which is used to find the minimum spanning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.88,
          "end": 11.18,
          "en": "tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.21,
          "end": 15.62,
          "en": "Now before we have find the minimum spanning tree using Kruskal's algorithm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.62,
          "end": 20.21,
          "en": "So here we are going to use the Prim's algorithm which is a grid algorithm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.21,
          "end": 24.02,
          "en": "And in our upcoming sections we are going to talk about what is grid algorithm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.02,
          "end": 24.44,
          "en": "Here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.44,
          "end": 29.27,
          "en": "We just need to know that we are using Prim's algorithm to find the minimum spanning tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.27,
          "end": 32.96,
          "en": "So let's say here again we have the graph like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.96,
          "end": 35.15,
          "en": "So this is the graph that we have used before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.15,
          "end": 39.65,
          "en": "So I'm going to use the same graph for finding the minimum spanning tree using Prim's algorithm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.65,
          "end": 44.24,
          "en": "Now here in case of the Prim's algorithm the logic is like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.24,
          "end": 51.08,
          "en": "First we take any vertex as a source vertex and the mark weight of that vertex to zero and all other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.08,
          "end": 52.43,
          "en": "vertices to infinity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.46,
          "end": 57.5,
          "en": "Now in our case, let's say as a source vertex, we are taking a and the weight we are going to put",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 57.5,
          "end": 59.69,
          "en": "initially zero from a.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 59.72,
          "end": 62.54,
          "en": "Then we are going to put the infinity to all other vertices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.57,
          "end": 69.05,
          "en": "Now the next step is for every adjacent unvisited vertex of the current vertex we compare their weights.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 69.05,
          "end": 75.73,
          "en": "So if the current weight of this adjacent vertex is more than the current age, then we update the adjacent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 75.73,
          "end": 77.44,
          "en": "vertices to the current age.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 77.47,
          "end": 80.92,
          "en": "Then the next step is we mark the current vertex as visited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 80.92,
          "end": 86.02,
          "en": "Then we are not coming to this vertex anymore and we continue with the smaller edge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 86.02,
          "end": 90.37,
          "en": "So on this graph we have said that we are going to start from the vertex of A.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 90.4,
          "end": 92.97999999999999,
          "en": "So I'm going to mark it as green.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.97999999999999,
          "end": 96.64,
          "en": "Then we are going to explore the all other neighbor vertices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 96.67,
          "end": 98.77000000000001,
          "en": "Now the first neighbor is b.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 98.77000000000001,
          "end": 102.94,
          "en": "So from A to b we can go with the five units.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.94,
          "end": 106.09,
          "en": "So we are going to update the weight of b to five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 106.12,
          "end": 109.18,
          "en": "Then we are going to continue to the next neighbor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.21000000000001,
          "end": 110.8,
          "en": "Now the next neighbor is C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.83,
          "end": 113.89,
          "en": "So from A to C it takes 35 units.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.89,
          "end": 117.31,
          "en": "So we are going to update the weight of the C to 35.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 117.34,
          "end": 120.01,
          "en": "Then we will continue to the next vertex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 120.01,
          "end": 124.3,
          "en": "Now the question is which vertex we need to continue to b or to c.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 124.3,
          "end": 127.15,
          "en": "So we are going to continue with the minimum weight.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 127.18,
          "end": 129.43,
          "en": "Now in our case in B we have five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 129.43,
          "end": 131.35,
          "en": "So we will continue to B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 131.38,
          "end": 135.52,
          "en": "Then we are going to take this edge because from a we come to the B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.52,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "So that's why a b h is considered as the first edge in the minimum spanning tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 145.82999999999998,
          "en": "So here again from B we can go to C, D and E we are going to explore all neighbors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 145.82999999999998,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "So from B to C it takes 20 units.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.96,
          "en": "So in C we have 35.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 150.96,
          "end": 153.45,
          "en": "So we see that 35 is greater than 20.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 153.45,
          "end": 155.79,
          "en": "So that's why we are going to update it to 20.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 158.79,
          "en": "Then we'll continue to the next edge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 158.79,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "Now the next edge is from B to D.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 165.3,
          "en": "So it takes 15 units and 15 is less than the infinity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.32999999999998,
          "end": 166.98,
          "en": "We are going to update it to 15.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.01,
          "end": 169.38,
          "en": "Then we are going to continue to the next edge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 171.72,
          "en": "Now the next edge is from B to E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.02,
          "end": 175.05,
          "en": "Now it takes ten units and it is less than infinity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 175.07999999999998,
          "end": 176.55,
          "en": "We are going to update it to ten.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.55,
          "end": 181.11,
          "en": "Now here again we need to select one edge to continue to the next vertex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.11,
          "end": 184.26,
          "en": "Now in our case the minimum one is ten which is E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.29,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "So that's why we will continue to e.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "Now from E you can easily see that we can go to B and B, but B is already visited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 194.61,
          "en": "We are not going to go back to this vertex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.61,
          "end": 196.23,
          "en": "So we will continue to d.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.26,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "Now from E to D it takes 25 units to go, but indeed the weight is 15, so 25 is greater than 15.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 206.76,
          "en": "That's why we are not going to update it to 15.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.76,
          "end": 208.91,
          "en": "So that's the only edge we have from E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.91,
          "end": 211.52,
          "en": "So in the next step we are going to continue with the minimum one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.55,
          "end": 213.23,
          "en": "Now the minimum one is D.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.26,
          "end": 216.11,
          "en": "But to D we are coming from the B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.14,
          "end": 219.74,
          "en": "That's why we are going to take this edge not from E to D.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.77,
          "end": 226.01,
          "en": "We are taking from B to D because from E to D it takes 25 minutes which is greater than 15.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.04,
          "end": 231.82999999999998,
          "en": "That's why the 15 that we updated in the D is coming from this edge from B to D.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 231.86,
          "end": 233.45,
          "en": "That's why we will take this edge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.48,
          "end": 236.12,
          "en": "Then from D we can go to E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 236.3,
          "end": 238.73,
          "en": "E is already visited and we can go to C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.73,
          "end": 240.29,
          "en": "So we are going to go to C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.29,
          "end": 242.03,
          "en": "So it takes ten units.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.03,
          "end": 243.56,
          "en": "And in C we have 20.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.59,
          "end": 245.27,
          "en": "That's why we are going to update it to ten.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 245.27,
          "end": 247.13,
          "en": "And we are going to take this edge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.13,
          "end": 249.65,
          "en": "Now one more time we are going to continue with the minimum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.65,
          "end": 250.64,
          "en": "So it is C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 250.64,
          "end": 254.15,
          "en": "So from C we can go to A to B and d.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.18,
          "end": 256.76,
          "en": "Now we can see that all vertices are visited.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 256.76,
          "end": 258.26,
          "en": "So we are not going to continue.",
